// ---- staging, L68 (round 12): a cue is drawn as the scene is drawn and to the figure's scale.
// - Where the object library has the thing, the cue IS the library object (objcomp LIB: the object cards' own renderer,
//   with its ink, texture and shading); composites put two library objects together (a tankard and its chaser).
